---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { WHATSAPP_BASE_URL } from '../../consts';
---

<BaseLayout
	title="Kushal's Flagship Store & Architectural Facade | Xpandor Case Study"
	description="Case study: Turnkey standalone flagship store for Kushal's Fashion & Silver Jewellery. Architectural wave facade, retail fit-out, storefront signage, and retail team staffing."
>
	<!-- Case Study Hero: Architectural Drafting Frame -->
	<section class="case-hero">
		<div class="container">
			<div class="hero-drafting-frame architectural-frame">
				<!-- Top Datum Bar -->
				<div class="datum-bar">
					<div class="datum-left">
						<a href="/work" class="back-link">← PROJECT ARCHIVE</a>
						<span class="datum-sep">/</span>
						<span class="datum-tag">DOSSIER BLR-CS-01</span>
					</div>
					<div class="datum-right">
						<span class="datum-coord">COMMERCIAL STREET, BENGALURU</span>
					</div>
				</div>

				<div class="hero-body">
					<div class="hero-eyebrow-wrap">
						<span class="eyebrow">Standalone Flagship Execution</span>
					</div>

					<h1 class="case-title">Kushal's Fashion & Silver Jewellery</h1>
					<p class="case-subtitle">
						Standalone high-street flagship store delivered with custom architectural wave facade, complete retail interior fit-out, illuminated signage, and pre-opening store staffing.
					</p>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<!-- Main Photo Feature: Contained Specimen Frame -->
	<section class="case-image-section">
		<div class="container">
			<div class="case-hero-img-wrap architectural-frame">
				<img 
					src="/images/kushals.jpeg" 
					alt="Kushal's Jewellery flagship store with illuminated wave facade" 
					class="case-main-img"
					width="1200"
					height="600"
				/>
				<span class="img-caption-tag">FIG 01. STANDALONE STOREFRONT & PARAMETRIC WAVE FACADE</span>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<!-- Structured Breakdown -->
	<section class="section case-body-section">
		<div class="container">
			<div class="case-grid">
				<!-- Left: Narrative Details -->
				<div class="case-details">
					<div class="detail-block">
						<h2 class="detail-heading">The Requirement</h2>
						<p>
							Kushal's required a prominent standalone flagship store to anchor their regional expansion in Bengaluru. The store needed to project a luxurious, modern, and inviting street aesthetic while optimizing floor circulation for high-value jewelry sales, security vitrines, and consultation desks.
						</p>
					</div>

					<div class="detail-block">
						<h2 class="detail-heading">The Challenge</h2>
						<p>
							The high-street property presented an elevated, multi-level front elevation requiring an architectural intervention to disguise structural upper floors while creating an intimate ground-floor retail environment. Furthermore, the handover deadline was strictly tied to the upcoming festive shopping season, demanding synchronized scheduling between facade engineering, interior millwork, and staff onboarding.
						</p>
					</div>

					<div class="detail-block">
						<h2 class="detail-heading">What Xpandor Handled</h2>
						<ul class="handled-list">
							<li>
								<strong>Architectural Wave Facade:</strong>
								<span>Engineered and mounted the parametric backlit wave facade panels flanking the upper elevation, creating an unmistakable high-street nighttime landmark.</span>
							</li>
							<li>
								<strong>Storefront & Regional Signage:</strong>
								<span>Fabricated 3D front-lit channel brand lettering in English alongside precision-crafted regional script signage for statutory compliance.</span>
							</li>
							<li>
								<strong>Turnkey Retail Fit-Out:</strong>
								<span>Executed civil flooring, multi-tier false ceiling coves, high-CRI jewelry display lighting, security counters, and consultation islands.</span>
							</li>
							<li>
								<strong>Store Opening Staffing:</strong>
								<span>Managed the end-to-end recruitment, in-person vetting, and joining coordination for the frontline retail sales team and store supervisors.</span>
							</li>
						</ul>
					</div>

					<div class="detail-block">
						<h2 class="detail-heading">Execution & Result</h2>
						<p>
							By managing both physical fabrication (facade + fit-out) and workforce deployment concurrently, Xpandor eliminated the customary 2–3 week delay between construction handover and trading doors. The store opened on schedule for peak festive footfall, fully staffed and trading on day one.
						</p>
					</div>
				</div>

				<!-- Right: Quick Facts Sidebar -->
				<div class="case-sidebar">
					<div class="sidebar-box architectural-frame">
						<h3 class="sidebar-title">Project Specification</h3>
						<div class="sidebar-fact">
							<span class="fact-label">CLIENT</span>
							<span class="fact-val">Kushal's Fashion Jewellery</span>
						</div>
						<div class="sidebar-fact">
							<span class="fact-label">CATEGORY</span>
							<span class="fact-val">Fine Fashion Jewellery</span>
						</div>
						<div class="sidebar-fact">
							<span class="fact-label">FORMAT</span>
							<span class="fact-val">Standalone High-Street Flagship</span>
						</div>
						<div class="sidebar-fact">
							<span class="fact-label">LOCATION</span>
							<span class="fact-val">Commercial Street, Bengaluru</span>
						</div>
						<div class="sidebar-fact">
							<span class="fact-label">FOOTPRINT</span>
							<span class="fact-val">2,200 Sq. Ft.</span>
						</div>
						<div class="sidebar-fact">
							<span class="fact-label">HANDOVER</span>
							<span class="fact-val">38 Days (On Schedule)</span>
						</div>
						<div class="sidebar-fact">
							<span class="fact-label">SCOPE OF DELIVERY</span>
							<span class="fact-val">Civil • Wave Facade • MEP • Millwork • Staffing</span>
						</div>

						<a 
							href={`${WHATSAPP_BASE_URL}?text=Hi%20Preetham,%20I'd%20like%20to%20discuss%20a%20flagship%20store%20rollout%20similar%20to%20Kushals.`}
							target="_blank"
							rel="noopener noreferrer"
							class="btn btn-gold btn-sidebar"
						>
							<span>Inquire About Similar Project</span>
						</a>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
	.case-hero {
		padding: 4.5rem 0 2rem;
	}

	@media (max-width: 768px) {
		.case-hero {
			padding: 2.5rem 0 1.5rem;
		}
	}

	.hero-drafting-frame {
		background: var(--bg-surface);
		border-radius: var(--radius-xs);
		overflow: hidden;
	}

	.datum-bar {
		display: flex;
		justify-content: space-between;
		align-items: center;
		padding: 0.85rem 2rem;
		border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
		background: rgba(11, 13, 19, 0.6);
		font-family: var(--font-mono);
		font-size: 0.72rem;
		letter-spacing: 0.12em;
	}

	@media (max-width: 768px) {
		.datum-bar {
			flex-direction: column;
			align-items: flex-start;
			gap: 0.4rem;
			padding: 0.75rem 1.25rem;
		}
	}

	.datum-left {
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 0.5rem;
	}

	.back-link {
		color: var(--accent-gold);
		font-weight: 600;
	}

	.back-link:hover {
		text-decoration: underline;
	}

	.datum-tag {
		color: var(--text-main);
		font-weight: 700;
	}

	.datum-sep {
		color: var(--text-subdued);
	}

	.datum-coord {
		color: var(--text-subdued);
	}

	.hero-body {
		padding: 3.5rem 3rem 3rem;
		max-width: 960px;
	}

	@media (max-width: 768px) {
		.hero-body {
			padding: 2rem 1.25rem;
		}
	}

	.hero-eyebrow-wrap {
		margin-bottom: 1rem;
	}

	.case-title {
		font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 4.5vw, 3.4rem);
		font-weight: 600;
		line-height: 1.15;
		letter-spacing: -0.025em;
		margin: 0.5rem 0 1rem;
		color: var(--text-main);
	}

	.case-subtitle {
		font-size: clamp(1rem, 1.4vw, 1.15rem);
		color: var(--text-muted);
		max-width: 780px;
		line-height: 1.7;
		margin: 0;
	}

	.case-image-section {
		padding: 1rem 0 3rem;
	}

	.case-hero-img-wrap {
		border-radius: var(--radius-xs);
		overflow: hidden;
		position: relative;
		background: #000;
	}

	.case-main-img {
		width: 100%;
		height: auto;
		max-height: 560px;
		object-fit: cover;
		display: block;
	}

	.img-caption-tag {
		position: absolute;
		bottom: 1rem;
		left: 1rem;
		font-family: var(--font-mono);
		font-size: 0.68rem;
		letter-spacing: 0.12em;
		background: rgba(11, 13, 19, 0.85);
		color: var(--accent-gold);
		padding: 0.35rem 0.75rem;
		border: 1px solid var(--border-brass);
		backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
		border-radius: 2px;
	}

	.case-grid {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: 1.8fr 1fr;
		gap: 3.5rem;
		align-items: start;
	}

	@media (max-width: 900px) {
		.case-grid {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
			gap: 2.5rem;
		}
	}

	.detail-block {
		margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
	}

	.detail-heading {
		font-size: 1.35rem;
		font-weight: 600;
		margin: 0 0 0.85rem;
		color: var(--text-main);
	}

	.detail-block p {
		font-size: 0.92rem;
		color: var(--text-muted);
		line-height: 1.7;
		margin: 0;
	}

	.handled-list {
		list-style: none;
		padding: 0;
		margin: 0;
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: 1.15rem;
	}

	.handled-list li {
		font-size: 0.9rem;
		color: var(--text-muted);
		line-height: 1.6;
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: 0.2rem;
	}

	.handled-list strong {
		color: var(--text-main);
		font-family: var(--font-display);
	}

	.sidebar-box {
		background: var(--bg-surface);
		border-radius: var(--radius-xs);
		padding: 2.25rem 2rem;
		position: sticky;
		top: 100px;
	}

	.sidebar-title {
		font-family: var(--font-mono);
		font-size: 0.72rem;
		letter-spacing: 0.14em;
		text-transform: uppercase;
		color: var(--accent-gold);
		margin: 0 0 1.5rem;
		padding-bottom: 0.75rem;
		border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
		font-weight: 700;
	}

	.sidebar-fact {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: 0.2rem;
		padding-bottom: 1rem;
		margin-bottom: 1rem;
		border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
	}

	.sidebar-fact:last-of-type {
		border-bottom: none;
		margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
	}

	.fact-label {
		font-family: var(--font-mono);
		font-size: 0.65rem;
		letter-spacing: 0.1em;
		color: var(--text-subdued);
	}

	.fact-val {
		font-size: 0.9rem;
		font-weight: 500;
		color: var(--text-main);
	}

	.btn-sidebar {
		width: 100%;
		font-size: 0.85rem;
		padding: 0.85rem 1rem;
	}
</style>
